  "description": "Stunning modern 1 bedroom apartment available to rent from the 6th of November 2026\n\nSituated beside Fumbally Lane, Cathedral Court is the perfect city centre located right in the heart of Dublin's creative quarter and just a short walking distance (500 metres) to the vibrant cafes and bars of Camden and Georges Street. Cathedral Court has all of Dublin's most popular shopping destinations less than a 10-minute walk away. Onsite is the trendy Fumbally Café as well as yoga & Pilates studios. These stunning apartments come fully furnished with custom-designed interiors and a wide range of on-site services including residents only gym, business centre, and recreation room. \n\nSó Living are delighted to offer a unique service experience in the rental market to facilitate the renting process and provide you with an unbeatable range of added services and amenities such as maintenance and security services, mailroom/on site-management office, beautifully landscaped gardens, and underground car parking in the heart of the city centre. \n\nCathedral Court Apartment Features - High-quality interior design finish with bespoke Italian furnishings throughout - Contemporary, fully-fitted kitchens and integrated high-spec appliances - Bathroom with heated towel rails, power shower and vanity unit - Balcony or patio with each apartment - Tiled hallway floors - Oak hardwood flooring - Fitted wardrobes with full-length mirror - 43\" 4k HD TV's as standard - Wired for SKY and Virgin Media TV and Internet - Ample storage \n\nCathedral Court Local Area - Located in heart of the city centre in one of Dublin's trendiest residential locations - Wide range of shops, restaurants, bars, hotels and transportation in immediate area - 10-minute walk to St Stephen's Green (10 mins) - 10-minute walk to the LUAS (St. Stephen's Green) - Small development of apartments - Manicured gardens with atmospheric night lighting \n\nServices offered at Cathedral Court include: - Residents' only state-of-the-art gym, recreation room and lounge - On-site management office - Dedicated property management team - Emergency maintenance service - CCTV monitored 24-hour on-site security - Secure underground parking (available at an additional cost) - Mail room/package storage service. \n\nTo truly appreciate the uniqueness of this property, viewing is strongly advised. Viewings are available upon request between the hours of 9-5 Monday to Friday. For more information on this property and other rental properties, please contact a member of our team today.\n\nFor more information please check out our new Website: www.so-living.ie",
